Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"My name is Kudō Shin'ichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm a famous high school student detective."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"However, one day when I visited an amusement park, with my childhood\Nfriend Ran..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"...where I witnessed two men in black being involved in a shady deal."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"And they poisoned me using a drug known as "APTX 4869".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Then when I came to..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.09,0:02:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"...my body had been shrunken."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"If the word has it that, I, Kudō Shin'ichi was still alive..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"...the Black Organization could bring danger\Nto all those around me."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"Under the alias of Edogawa Conan..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"...I solve countless cases while trying to obtain intel about the men in black who shrunk my body."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"But this is a case that occurred 100 days\Nbefore I became Edogawa Conan."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.83,0:02:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"While taking a trip with Ran and the rest,\Nwe came across a village's legend..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"...and became involved in\Nan impossible murder case."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mysterious murders in a row..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"...and I, too, faced setback by an unexpected trick."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A rumor about the high school student\Nwho's a great detective has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You've solved a murder case\Nonce again, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This time around it was a locked room case,\Nso how did you figure out who the murderer was?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:51.12,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204,299)}Teitan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:51.12,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\pos(144,519)}High School
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You were brilliant this time too, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What were your feelings when the police detectives\Nfound themselves in over their heads as you solved it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yes, this is me..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,879)}Kudō {\c&H1500AE&}Shin'{\c&HFFFFFF&}ichi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"...the high school student detective,\NKudō Shin'ichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Of course at the time I couldn't\Nhave even imagined that, in the near future..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"...I'd be returning here\Nas a grade school student."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, somehow or other...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kudō-san.\N- One word, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That was dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"She's Mōri Ran..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"...my childhood friend."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Deep down she's a good gal,\Nbut she's also strong in karate."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"We aren't dating though."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, break out, break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't feel reserved\Nand eat as much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.62,0:04:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran, you've been so worried about your figure,\Nthat you haven't been eating at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to actively\Ncompete anymore, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.\NI'll eat heartily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"It's awful!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.87,0:04:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been worried about my figure as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It itches. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently, when someone tells a lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...my left eye starts to itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I run into so many\Nincidents of it as a lawyer...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...but it bothers me most when\Nmy clients start lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that,\Nmy eye's gotten very sensitive to lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my predisposition towards\Ncause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's kind of an occupational disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"This person is Kisaki Eri."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"She's a shrewd lawyer who never\Nloses a case and she's Ran's mother."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"However she and Eri's father, Mōri Kogoro,\Nare separated, pending their divorce."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And? Shin'ichi-kun,\Nwhat were you lying about just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Bad cook"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mom, we have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran, I've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kudō-kun.\NPopular as ever, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"This stuff's awful!\NI don't want this."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy about it.\NI just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, it's awfully sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...but how about we all go to Jyugoya Village?\N(Jyugoya - Night of the full moon)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"This is Suzuki Sonoko..."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"...the daughter of the Suzuki Financial clique."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"She's one of Japan's richest people,\Nbut she's sociable and follows the latest fads."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:06:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"She's always inviting us to wherever\Nvarious incidents have occurred."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jyugoya Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend of Papa's built a villa there\Nand he's invited me to come visit at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be\Nthis friend of your father's is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan's biggest chain of taverns\Nthat you're the legal adviser for...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wakura Group’s President Wakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wakura said he\Nwants you to come, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If Wakura-san is asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...can't turn him down, now can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.11,0:06:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right!\N- All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want that person going with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Rascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ras...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's "Pascal."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so ambiguous...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally a raccoon's named Rascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours is far more clever\Nthan any 'Rascal' would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ala?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ala, I just heard some sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be Pascal!\NPlease go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You... want me to go up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Acrophobia"\NEh? You won't go up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I won't pay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I only came because you said\Nthere was a kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, did you say something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! There, wai...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wai...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"By the way, this old man\Nis Ran's father, Mōri Kogoro."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"He left the police\Nand opened a detective agency..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"...but as for his ability..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"...well, how can I put this..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.15,0:08:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we decided to leave him behind\Nand go to Jyugoya Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"Northeast Bus Stop\NJyugoya Village"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaa, we arrived at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are you still\Nin your school uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.57,0:08:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't help it.\NI couldn't go home, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Wakura, it's been awhile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.85,0:08:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wakura" Group President\NWakura Isamu"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello.\N- It's been awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my friend, Mōri Ran-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the famous high school\Nstudent detective, Kudō Shin'ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello.\N- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san, we're sorry for\Nforcing ourselves upon you like this today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, not at all.\NIt's an honor to have Sensei come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the village of the legendary Otori.\N(Otori - Large Bird)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Village of the legendary Otori"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In this village a long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.39,0:09:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...legend has it that a huge Mozu appeared,\Nattacking the villagers...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...and making them what is called a hayanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayanie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A Mozu catches insects and frogs...\N(Mozu - 'butcher bird' or shrike)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...and has the trait of\Nstabbing them on tree branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the Mozu's hayanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's characteristic is to stick them on\Nsharp objects like barbed wire and twigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Auntie, that surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, Dad, don't shock them\Nlike that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wakura's Second Daughter\NWakura Misa"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... How do you do,\NI'm his daughter Misa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.09,0:09:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san is helping us\Ninvestigate the Otori legend. I'm Kozaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.07,0:09:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"Graduate Student\NKozaka Sho"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be under your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I got caught up in\Nthe Otori legend just now. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"Jyugoya Village"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a beautiful place, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But, scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, the only access to\Nthe village is across this bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So do your best for a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.93,0:10:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Ran!\N- Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come in\Nthose sorts of shoes for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have brought some\Nthat were more for walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, Shin'ichi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,At her age, the emphasis is\Nmore on appearance than practicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.93,0:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Appearance? Who's going to be\Nlooking at you here in the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you totally don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fall, you'll definitely die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.12,0:11:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi, stop it! You're the lowest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you guys!\NThat's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.89,0:11:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's slippery through here,\Nso please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're a guy, you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push! That's dangerous. All right, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mozutobi Shrine" (Flying Mozu Shrine)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are women\Nand yet way too over strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the characteristics of\Nthe village's Otori legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very similar to the legend of Forbina\Nleft behind by the Mayan civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since my school days...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:12:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...I've been chasing cases across the globe\Nof legendary monstrous birds like the Otori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's a possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...there remains in this village\Nsomething transmitted from...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...the ancient Mayan civilization to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It could lead to a tremendous discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,People of the village call it, "God's Perch."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mozutobi Shrine\NGod's Perch"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the place where\Nsacrifices were made to Otori-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrifices?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,One would be chosen as a hayanie\Nand be sacrificed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's said that Otori-sama's anger...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...would thus be dispelled and that famine and\Ncatastrophe would hopefully not occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There are others like this\Nhere and there around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you have guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great we have\Nsuch fine weather, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you as the police\Nhave business at the shrine, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was pressed into helping with\Nthe preparations for the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, is there a festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,3 days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of festival is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here at the Mozutobi Shrine,\Nthere's to be a festival to Otori-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.51,0:13:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to calm\NOtori-sama's turbulent soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...they'll be dressed as birds\Nand chant prayers while dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But, for this year only,\Nthis one will be special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Mr. Policeman?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A bronze mirror, which is a national treasure\Nthat can only be viewed once every 300 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...will be here at the inner shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The festival 3 days from now\Nonly comes once every 300 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Once every 300 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're super lucky, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We get to see a hidden mirror in an unexplored area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.54,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: Both words are pronounced the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.54,Pun1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1645,751)}Hikyou
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.54,Pun1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1653,867)}(hidden mirror)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.54,Pun2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(233,743)}Hikyou
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.54,Pun2,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(249,867)}(An unexplored area)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hikyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.07,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: Ran doesn't get the other meaning of 'hikyou'
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It means "secret mirror."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me explain my puns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But, it really is a secret mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that when the bronze mirror\Nresonates with the God's Perch...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...mysterious things occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What mysterious things?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the ancient literature...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...something very much like\Na total solar eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A total solar eclipse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I'm sure the next time one of those\Nwill be seen in Japan won't be until 2035.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.61,0:14:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But, believers have their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the people in the village\Nthink what will happen is they'll be cursed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...and it seems they're getting\Na little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:15:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Because it's so long-awaited,\Nreally, please stay here until the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mozutobi Shrine"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you listen to what I just told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:15:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wakura's Eldest Son\NWakura Yoichi"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wakura's Eldest Daughter\NWakura Kotomi"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what caused this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wakura's Second Son\NWakura Ryoji"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incomprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,While all of us were\Nwalking around and chatting...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...we thought we heard a bird cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then suddenly, Kozaka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true! We then realized Kozaka-san\Nhad been stuck up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's regrettable that I'm the one still safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NAre you in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That truly is regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji-niisan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudō-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.77,0:16:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudō-kun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"This person is Megure Juzo."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"He's Ran's father's former boss."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"He's called the 'Demon Capitan of the MPD...'"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"...but truth is, he's also a devoted husband."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing at a place like this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I was invited by Sonoko to come\Nto a villa here in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Megure, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I had come to train\Nthe police in this prefecture...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...so when they said a murder case had occurred,\NI came to help out in the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Otori-sama's curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The people being attacked are its hayanie...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.31,0:17:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...it's the legendary Otori coming true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawn in by the\Nonce-every-300 years festival...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...and because of the Wakura clan's selfish\Ninvestigation into and excavation of the ruins...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...Otori-sama has been angered!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as the storyteller says!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.85,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:17:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems to be called "the storyteller."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the one who manages the shrine here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... This investigation will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.01,0:18:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In order that we may investigate the corpse,\Nhe will be taken down to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.23,0:18:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we'll be listening to\Nthe circumstances of each of you in turn...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...please, none of you leave the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the crime scene must be preserved...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...definitely don't meddle around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You are? Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Policeman Haji at your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to be working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"People can't die from a legend."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"This is..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"...a case of murder."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"This impossible murder mystery..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"I will solve it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Heiwa Fansubs Presents:\NDetective Conan\NCommemorating the 15th Anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudō Shin'ichi:\NMizobata Jyunpei
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mōri Ran:\NKutsuna Shiori
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuki Sonoko:\NAkimoto Sayaka (of AKB48)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Megure Juzo:\NItake Masato
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisaki Eri:\NOtsuka Nene
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mōri Kogoro:\NJinnai Takanori
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective Conan Drama Special
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge to Kudō Shin'ichi\NRiddle of the Mysterious Legendary Bird
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wakura Family Villa"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well... sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bret Nelli, where is your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaa... What did he come for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.40,0:20:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The conversation doesn't seem to be\Nas lively as I had imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, you can't fill in the void\Nwhen you're missing a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you that when it comes to the art of\Ntalking mysteries, you have a long ways to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the bad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:21:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a murder case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, most regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If this detective, Mōri Kogoro,\Nhad come just a little earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...like that, I would have caught the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If the culprit was stupid enough\Nto be caught by you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...Shin'ichi-kun would have\Ncaught him ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to detective work, he's my pupil.\NI taught him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, itchy, itchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.36,0:21:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here you are.\N- Thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, your father\Nseems to be a huge bird lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds, here, there and everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My father is serious about\Ninvestigating the Otori legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing how passionate he is\Nin buying up all the land in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.19,0:21:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look carefully; that's a hot guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonoko, that's imprudent at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I, the great detective\NMōri Kogoro have come...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...this case is as good as solved already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell your father, "be at ease."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, itchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.30,0:22:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could have an aperitif, my head would\Nbecome increasingly clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so itchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.65,0:22:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As way of saying thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...I, the great detective Mōri Kogoro,\Nwill settle this incident perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.47,0:23:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, I have already...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.23,0:23:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...determined the culprit's objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the culprit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.34,0:23:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A human!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.17,0:23:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...this Otori legend is simply a superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.61,0:23:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In this 21st century, for educated adults\Nto be misled by a superstition...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...is absolutely disgraceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.51,0:23:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a concrete idea\Nabout who the suspect is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Otori legend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't such things in many cases told\Nin order to protect a treasure from looters?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.08,0:24:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.90,0:24:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...there's a real treasure\Nburied in this village?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.32,0:24:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want to look for the\NTokigawa buried treasure, don't you?\N(famed lost treasure)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.44,0:24:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tokigawa buried treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A man's romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What man's romance?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tokigawa buried treasure, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.02,0:24:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I declare it on my tax returns?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.00,0:24:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a romantic legend about this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? What is it? Please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.80,0:24:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That lovers who exchange kisses\Nbeneath the God's Perch...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.91,0:24:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...will never be parted and be married for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.29,0:25:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a legend only girls\Nwould feel like believing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.63,0:25:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran, you should give it a test!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.09,0:25:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't test that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"Something called Otori that's attacking\Nvillage people and making them its hayanie."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.77,0:25:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"And a legend of a kiss in this village."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"There's a fairly wide mismatch here."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.60,0:25:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, earlier at the scene of the crime,\NI picked this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.85,0:25:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These carvings...\NI wonder if they're characters?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.48,0:25:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're similar to the characters\Nused at the Fobina ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm certain, this means "curse."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.05,0:25:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"Curse"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.48,0:25:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you know what this piece is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.61,0:26:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.60,0:26:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.59,0:26:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san?! Wakura-san!\NAre you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.83,0:26:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.54,0:26:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.14,0:26:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.17,0:26:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.04,0:26:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.71,0:26:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san! Wakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.11,0:26:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.58,0:26:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.03,0:27:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.99,0:27:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This just struck so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.49,0:27:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.00,0:27:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ala? Where's Wakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.00,0:27:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a power outage.\NWhat are you so worked up over?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.04,0:27:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.94,0:27:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A bird-man suddenly appeared and...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.41,0:27:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoichi-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.81,0:27:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father had a spasm and Ryoji-{\i1}san{\i0}\Nand the others attended him back to his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.95,0:27:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My father had a... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.35,0:27:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,His room...?\NDidn't you call an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.88,0:27:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.62,0:27:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,An ambulance would be\Nexaggerating things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.15,0:27:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Having him examined by some country hospital\Nwould be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:28:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If his condition's still bad in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.39,0:28:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...we'll take him to Tokyo\Nto be examined there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.93,0:28:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.13,0:28:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he really be okay like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.50,0:28:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does die in the village of the\Nlegendary Otori that he loves so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.83,0:28:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...he'd be satisfied, wouldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.34,0:28:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.41,0:28:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.41,0:28:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.81,0:28:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.58,0:28:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was having a smoke in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.15,0:28:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.02,0:28:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"Upon the entire Wakura family..."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.76,0:28:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"...who fouls our sacred precinct..."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.90,0:28:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"...we place a curse to be killed."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"Curse"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.86,0:28:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"Killed"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.91,0:28:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"The culprit most likely deliberately\Nplaced this piece at the crime scene..."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.98,0:28:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"...in order to bring out Wakura-san's spasm\Nwhen he saw this 'curse' character."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.62,0:29:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"And clearly, this is a character\Nand a portion of a picture."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.59,0:29:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"If my inference is correct..."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.46,0:29:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"...when the pieces are put back together..."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.39,0:29:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"...the culprit's true motives will appear."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.15,0:29:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.98,0:29:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ruins\NGod's Perch"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.35,0:29:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.28,0:29:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling me out in the\Nmiddle of the night like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.22,0:29:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about the distribution of the property?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ala?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.79,0:30:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The paper the threatening letter\Nis on has no characteristics about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.03,0:30:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's commonly used in newspapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.23,0:30:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever issued this threatening letter,\Nwe won't find out from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.60,0:30:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to send it to forensics\Nand let them investigate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.94,0:30:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.28,0:30:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a detective here, so listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.58,0:30:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.58,0:30:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wakura chain has 4,000 branches\Nacross the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.59,0:30:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000 employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, given only just those,\Nsome incident is bound to occur every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.43,0:30:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could solve this one case here\Nand that became well-known...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.04,0:31:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...I could be employed by them\Nas a special-adviser detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.77,0:31:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Special Adviser Detective,\NMōri Kogoro is born!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.41,0:31:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll collect consultant fees\Neach and every month!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.39,0:31:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.92,0:31:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.09,0:31:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.40,0:31:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.80,0:31:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.39,0:31:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because something like that happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.83,0:32:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...will the festival be canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.43,0:32:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.27,0:32:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But, it only comes 1 day every 300 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.57,0:32:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Once every 300 years, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.94,0:32:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi, do you think a total solar eclipse\Nwill really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.58,0:32:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A total eclipse would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.21,0:32:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I am a little interested in\Nwhat might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.02,0:32:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.09,0:32:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is being a little interested all there is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.56,0:32:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.39,0:32:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.46,0:32:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...there's that romantic story, too,\Nisn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.04,0:32:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.27,0:32:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.24,0:32:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?\NWhat are you so angry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.69,0:32:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"That lovers who exchange kisses\Nbeneath the God's Perch..."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.82,0:33:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"...will never be parted\Nand be married for life."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.49,0:33:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kiss..."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.26,0:33:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,To the edge of the light, calm down...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.26,0:33:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.10,0:33:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we need to inform Inspector Megure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good. Like I thought,\Ncell phones can't get through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.07,0:33:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please do.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.97,0:33:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.95,0:34:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"Another one."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.05,0:34:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Like I thought..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.22,0:34:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"...the culprit is leaving one\Nat each of his killing sites."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.29,0:34:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The light...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.16,0:34:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"When I seriously consider the situation..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"...he couldn't have been killed\Nby being stabbed."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.14,0:34:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"So how did the culprit\Nget Ryoji-san up there..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.51,0:34:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"Moreover, just what on earth\Nwas that sound...?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.81,0:34:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To the edge of the light, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The phones weren't working...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.79,0:34:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...and my father and the others\Nare investigating the cause right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.23,0:34:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.87,0:34:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.27,0:34:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.95,0:35:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.98,0:35:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.12,0:35:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.79,0:35:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We were too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.00,0:35:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.66,0:35:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridge didn't fall on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit cut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.70,0:35:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know this would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.07,0:35:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When you told me\Nthe phones weren't working...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.37,0:35:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...I realized the culprit was trying to\Nconfine us here to this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.15,0:35:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Until all of his serial killings are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.68,0:35:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"All"? You mean there'll be more?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.02,0:35:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.26,0:35:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Until this piece is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.87,0:35:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji-niisan! Niisan!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.17,0:35:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Niisan!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.10,0:36:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.34,0:36:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can't leave this village?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.87,0:36:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.54,0:36:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The walkie-talkies at the police station\Nare also broken...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the phones can't be used, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.75,0:36:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The walkie-talkies, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.92,0:36:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Otori-sama's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.82,0:36:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Otori-sama has gotten angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.29,0:36:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry and leave this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.43,0:36:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Get out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.53,0:36:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make Otori-sama any angrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.83,0:36:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.13,0:36:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please calm down a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.94,0:36:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we'll figure how to\Nrepair the bridge and phones...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.51,0:36:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...please return to your homes for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.71,0:36:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, just in case,\Nplease stay in groups...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.91,0:36:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...and don't let yourselves\Nend up alone. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.48,0:36:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The suspension bridge to the other side\Nfrom the village has collapsed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.59,0:36:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.22,0:36:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the culprit let\Nthe suspension bridge from the village fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.13,0:36:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- In other words...\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.56,0:37:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is still in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.27,0:37:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will be next?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.70,0:37:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.17,0:37:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in accordance with the threatening letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely the next one will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.71,0:37:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Me or Yoichi-niisan...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.51,0:37:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...or maybe you, Misa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.95,0:37:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We finished dinner at 9 pm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.26,0:37:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,At that time,\NRyoji-san was still here in the villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.99,0:37:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.53,0:37:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran and I went out for a walk\Nand found his corpse at 11 pm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For those 2 hours between 9 pm and 11 pm...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.40,0:37:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...everyone please confirm their alibis.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.67,0:37:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alibi...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.31,0:37:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One of us killed Ryoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.61,0:37:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.98,0:37:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you told us, would that cause\Nsome sort of trouble for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.91,0:37:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.32,0:37:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Until 10 pm, I was with Ran\Nand her mother talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.75,0:37:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...but after that I went to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.56,0:38:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have an alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.33,0:38:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.59,0:38:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the same for\NYoichi-niisan and Misa, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.03,0:38:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.77,0:38:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...there's our father, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.90,0:38:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.62,0:38:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.96,0:38:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi, do you understand what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.07,0:38:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, this is "betrayal."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.04,0:38:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is "curse."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.34,0:38:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this man doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.58,0:38:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he running?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.38,0:39:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of meaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.09,0:39:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...is there to this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.61,0:39:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.48,0:39:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Misa-san, this was freshly-squeezed, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.55,0:39:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a man who can tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.85,0:39:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just from a regular carton of milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.32,0:39:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez... (mou...)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.53,0:39:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"Moo"? Was that a pun?\NThat was a pun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.47,0:39:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.21,0:39:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to have much of an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.51,0:40:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji-san and Kozaka-san's murderer\Nhasn't been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.15,0:40:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The phones aren't working and the\Nsuspension bridge has been felled.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.09,0:40:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The walkie-talkies at\Nthe police station are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.22,0:40:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if those were our only concerns,\Nthis wouldn't be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.63,0:40:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But please everyone, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.33,0:40:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The name that resound around the world,\NMōri Kogoro, is luckily right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.71,0:40:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where in the world does it resound?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.61,0:40:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Does your world have a radius of 1 meter?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.71,0:40:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up with your complaints\Nabout the little things!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.38,0:40:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's only 50 cm! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.15,0:40:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to ask all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.49,0:40:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there anyone who bore\Na grudge against Ryoji-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.63,0:40:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He did a lot of things, but I don't think\Nhe made any enemies who'd want to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But, he was in debt, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.13,0:40:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.53,0:40:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.64,0:41:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji was managing a restaurant\Nseparate from the Wakura chain...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.34,0:41:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...but it wasn't going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.68,0:41:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the amount\Nof his debts were, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.31,0:41:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.01,0:41:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what sort of work\Ndo you do, Yoichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.22,0:41:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now I'm raising funds to start\Na business making earnings from stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.82,0:41:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"Raising funds"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.46,0:41:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoichi-niisan's only wanted pocket money\Nso he could make tiny trades over the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.06,0:41:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, just the other day\Nyou secretly went to Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.33,0:41:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...crying about how you'd\Nsuffered a huge loss in FX.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.07,0:41:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better than some dull guy\Nwho has to be financially supported.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.07,0:41:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard your boyfriend's a musician\Nwho hasn't even sold a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.41,0:41:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.18,0:41:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.28,0:41:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.61,0:41:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this messed-up questioning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.85,0:41:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a long ways to go\Nbefore you're a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.85,0:41:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Green. Too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.29,0:41:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know who the culprit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.73,0:42:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the culprit?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.73,0:42:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.00,0:42:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.57,0:42:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.28,0:42:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...you, Yoichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.65,0:42:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.22,0:42:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This unusual cigarette is yours, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.45,0:42:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I clearly saw you smoking one yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.52,0:42:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I discovered this one at the site\Nwhere Ryoji-san was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.46,0:42:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This great detective's eagle eye\Ndoesn't miss anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.47,0:42:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break! Just because I smoke\Ndoesn't make me the murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.94,0:42:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerk! Do you intend to deny it! You bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.67,0:42:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.38,0:42:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we agreed that Yoichi-san went\Nto the scene and left a cigarette butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.82,0:42:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...you're stretching things a bit, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.82,0:42:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.29,0:43:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,These butts were carelessly left\Nin every ashtray in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.89,0:43:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That means anyone who came into the house\Nwould have been able to take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.86,0:43:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So this one doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.33,0:43:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.73,0:43:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.44,0:43:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is important evidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.84,0:43:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it was a serious loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.61,0:43:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, but... Kozaka-san and Ryoji's death\Nwould really make Yoichi-niisan happy though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.71,0:43:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?\NThat'd be you Kotomi, wouldn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.72,0:43:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.66,0:43:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Excuse me as well.\NI'll go see to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.90,0:43:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.74,0:43:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you keep an eye on Kotomi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.18,0:43:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.58,0:43:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sonoko, on Yoichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.18,0:43:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Shin'ichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.78,0:44:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.39,0:44:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...be on Misa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.39,0:44:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.63,0:44:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to be sleeping well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.10,0:44:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.50,0:44:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder when the\Nsuspension bridge will be restored?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.80,0:44:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take him to the hospital right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.48,0:45:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudō-kun, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.11,0:45:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and catch the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.85,0:45:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.16,0:45:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Misa-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.76,0:45:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...could I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.96,0:45:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotomi-san mentioned this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.23,0:45:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That if Kozaka-san and Ryoji-san were dead,\NYoichi-san would be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.10,0:45:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.47,0:45:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Misa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.51,0:45:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When my father declared he would invest his\Nentire fortune into investigating the Otori legend...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.59,0:45:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...my older brothers and sister\Nwere opposed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.63,0:45:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, my father told us...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.36,0:45:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kozaka-kun should have been my son."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.80,0:45:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have no intention of leaving\Nany of you my assets."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.37,0:46:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have no intention of leaving\Nany of you my assets."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.61,0:46:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kozaka-kun would use it more effectively."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.24,0:46:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that came as a great shock\Nto my brothers and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.41,0:46:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoichi-niisan definitely seems to be in debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.55,0:46:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But, that's also why it'd be impossible for him to\Ndo anything to either Kozaka-san or Ryoji-niisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.79,0:46:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.\NWon't you stop this play and wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.06,0:46:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure my sister wouldn't have\Nany reason to, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.17,0:46:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.64,0:46:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,...after my father became\Nengrossed in the Otori legend...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.61,0:46:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...it became awkward around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.31,0:46:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"I will tell you how to\Nmonopolize the inheritance."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.71,0:46:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Come to Jyugoya Falls'\NGod's Perch at 3 o'clock."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.66,0:46:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking about how it might happen again...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.59,0:46:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...worries and worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.53,0:47:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely it wouldn't come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.40,0:47:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.34,0:47:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The God's Perch is about 6 meters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.14,0:47:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Kozaka-san and Ryoji-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.15,0:47:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...weighed a little more\Nthan 60 kg each, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.85,0:47:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How did the culprit...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.59,0:48:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...stick them up there at that height?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.19,0:48:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That is accursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.66,0:48:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.06,0:48:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be the fourth person\Nto become a hayanie?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.57,0:48:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth person?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.44,0:48:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean\Nwhen you say 'the fourth person.'?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.01,0:48:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who other than Kozaka-san\Nand Ryoji-san were taken as hayanie?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.18,0:48:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best not to wander around\Nthe holy place without good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.35,0:48:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.68,0:48:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.35,0:48:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...and when did they become a hayanie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.72,0:48:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't know.\N- Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.66,0:48:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don't know, so I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.46,0:48:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.59,0:48:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is still...\NThey're definitely still in this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.20,0:48:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the deed of a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.10,0:48:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Otori-sama's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.01,0:48:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wakura clan set off Otori-sama's anger...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.51,0:48:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...and so it made them hayanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.62,0:49:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The festival will be soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.72,0:49:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more, the total solar eclipse\Nthat only happens once every 300 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.39,0:49:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Otori-sama will certainly appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.20,0:49:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.53,0:49:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.64,0:49:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. When I took my eyes off her\Nfor just a minute, Kotomi-san disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.61,0:49:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.09,0:49:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotomi-san, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.03,0:49:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.77,0:49:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.43,0:49:52.47,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1641,779)}Jyugoya Falls
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.43,0:49:52.47,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1753,1067)}God's Perch
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.50,0:49:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.69,0:50:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Otori.\NTo the edge of the light, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.01,0:50:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi?! Kotomi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.38,0:50:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.99,0:50:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudō-kun! Kudō-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.53,0:51:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.27,0:51:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.00,0:51:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Somehow or other.\N- Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.47,0:51:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotomi-san, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.84,0:51:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm really very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.71,0:51:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt this sudden sensation\Nand then I flew...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.11,0:51:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Flew?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.75,0:51:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?\NWhat, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.12,0:51:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ala? Where's Ran?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.25,0:51:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She was running off in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.56,0:51:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.39,0:51:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:52:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.17,0:52:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.67,0:52:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.98,0:52:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.08,0:52:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.99,0:52:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.22,0:52:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran! Are you okay, Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.69,0:52:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.56,0:52:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.53,0:52:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.60,0:52:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.80,0:52:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But, when I kicked the culprit's\Nright hand, something flew out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.04,0:52:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.01,0:52:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...why did you do something\Nso reckless on your own for?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.84,0:52:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.98,0:52:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! Sir! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.48,0:52:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.45,0:52:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.29,0:53:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?\NMaking us worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.91,0:53:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.88,0:53:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.35,0:53:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck, I'm drenched! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.39,0:53:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been clear all day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.17,0:53:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.67,0:53:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.87,0:53:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But then you'll feel cold, Shin'ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.91,0:53:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.89,0:54:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.56,0:54:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi's here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.67,0:54:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pitiful I'm just stuck here\Nand can't rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.40,0:54:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.47,0:54:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy that we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.54,0:54:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.01,0:54:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...even if it hadn't been me...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.88,0:54:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...you would have gone out\Nto rescue anyone, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.32,0:54:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.47,0:54:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that just now? A raccoon dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.47,0:54:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.94,0:55:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A raccoon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.98,0:55:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.45,0:55:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You said raccoon just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.45,0:55:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.28,0:55:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh... where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.89,0:55:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can catch that raccoon,\NI can substitute it for Pascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.46,0:55:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.62,0:55:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this 'substitute Pascal' talk?\NRaccoons are usually called Rascal, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.86,0:55:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's a Pascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.30,0:55:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I was chasing after this raccoon\Nand I ended up down here...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.33,0:55:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ahold of yourself, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.17,0:55:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pascal...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.20,0:55:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Pascal?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.07,0:55:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The French philosopher and physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.98,0:55:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pascal's law is the basis for fluid dynamics...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.98,0:55:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.21,0:55:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.68,0:55:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.65,0:55:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi! Hurry and do something about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.25,0:55:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what are YOU doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.99,0:55:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran's an adult already...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.03,0:55:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...so if you bother her anymore,\Nshe'll hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.23,0:55:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, this was those two's\Nbig chance, right, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.20,0:55:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- It wasn't like that!\N- It wasn't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.64,0:56:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Itchy, itchy, itchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.57,0:56:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, this is the itchiest!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.64,0:56:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pascal!\NPascal, were have you gone!?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.44,0:56:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pascal!!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you go to that place\Nall by yourself for?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.92,0:56:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was called.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.89,0:56:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You were called? By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.49,0:56:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.96,0:56:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a letter in my pocket\Nfrom some unknown person.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.76,0:56:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still have that letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.00,0:56:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.23,0:56:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What was written in the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.30,0:56:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.17,0:56:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"I will tell you how to\Nmonopolize the inheritance."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.28,0:56:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the one targeting\Nthe inheritance not me, but you, Kotomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.65,0:56:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!\NI wouldn't consider such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.92,0:56:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.42,0:56:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...whoever called me away\Nmay be the one who killed Ryoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.76,0:57:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The clue to the culprit...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.26,0:57:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this 'clue'?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.00,0:57:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your target is the inheritance!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.77,0:57:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait, you two.\NInheritance, inheritance!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.50,0:57:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's not even dead yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.89,0:57:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.49,0:57:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you had to see something so unseemly.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.67,0:57:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.58,0:57:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.59,0:57:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"Curse."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"Betrayal."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.33,0:58:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It just needs one more piece to complete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.00,0:58:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.07,0:58:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...there will definitely be\None more incident that occurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.34,0:58:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely determined to prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.28,0:58:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Do you want to be the fourth person\Nto become a hayanie?"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.42,0:58:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"Who other than Kozaka-san\Nand Ryoji-san were taken as hayanie?"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.44,0:58:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Jyugoya Police Substation"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.34,0:58:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"Jyugoya Police Substation"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.01,0:59:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.78,0:59:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.82,0:59:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.12,0:59:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.49,0:59:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Has something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.06,0:59:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.59,0:59:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like you to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.26,0:59:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.66,0:59:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At the God's Perch before all this, there was\Nsomeone else who was a hayanie, wasn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.84,0:59:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the nail, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.71,0:59:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.64,0:59:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.08,0:59:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya...yer noisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.48,0:59:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's when Tokyo people like you come...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.62,0:59:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...that things happen that bring no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.79,0:59:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokyo people?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.45,0:59:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,By "Tokyo people,"\Ndo you mean the Wakura-sans?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.42,0:59:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that Wakura-san had been\Nto this village previously?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.93,0:59:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have ta tell ya nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.50,0:59:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Takekura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.40,0:59:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.00,0:59:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that suspension bridge's repaired,\Nhurry and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.41,0:59:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.\NI was just a little interested in something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.21,1:00:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Documentation on the history of the village...\NWould anything here be helpful?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.84,1:00:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.97,1:00:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Jyugoya Village Town Hall"
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.08,1:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For records on those who have died,\NI guess I'd still have to go to Town Hall...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.45,1:00:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ala?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.29,1:00:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Misa-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.20,1:01:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.31,1:01:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...a bronze mirror?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.70,1:01:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"I see."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.70,1:01:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,"These were opposing mirrors..."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.31,1:01:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"...connected from back to back."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.09,1:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"Found at the Fobina ruins [name]"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.25,1:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"Man"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.82,1:01:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Man?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.99,1:02:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"Similarities between\Nthe Mayan Civilization's Fobina Ruins..."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.50,1:02:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"...and Jyugoya Village."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.80,1:02:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mayan Civilization's Fobina Ruins."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.77,1:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"Monstrous Bird."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.44,1:02:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Jyugoya Village."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.64,1:02:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Otori."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.54,1:02:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Light of the Sun."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.01,1:02:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"Reaching the pyramid."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.28,1:02:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"The bronze mirror on God's Perch."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.45,1:02:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Resonance."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.85,1:02:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Coming down from Heaven."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.22,1:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"Flying down from Heaven."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.36,1:02:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sacrifice... to God."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.37,1:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hayanie."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.28,1:02:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fobina Ruins"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.69,1:03:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"Underground water"?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.02,1:03:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"Jyugoya Village"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.40,1:03:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"The God's Perches are landmarks\Nfor underground water?!"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.14,1:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"First."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.38,1:03:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"This is where Kozaka-san's death took place..."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.81,1:03:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"And here's Ryoji-san's."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.28,1:03:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"And here's where Kotomi-san flew..."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.27,1:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"Konno Machiko\N1986 death"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.20,1:04:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Konno Machiko.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.17,1:04:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Don't come near!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.01,1:04:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a place where the Wakura\Nand those associated with them cannot come near!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.05,1:04:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.78,1:04:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that this death\Nis related somehow to Wakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.89,1:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.80,1:04:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And just who was the one\Nthat was a hayanie before?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.77,1:04:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.88,1:05:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how much...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.38,1:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...do you know about\Nthe legend of this village?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.02,1:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.95,1:05:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...it's said a giant Mozu bird\Nmade a hayanie out of a person.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.56,1:05:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The bronze mirror in the shrine\Nresonates with the God's Perch...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.99,1:05:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...once every 300 years\Nto cause a solar total eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.30,1:05:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And that...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.50,1:05:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...lovers who exchange kisses\Nunder the Perch...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.94,1:05:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...will never leave one another\Ntheir entire lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.78,1:05:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.71,1:05:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that everything about the legend?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.91,1:05:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there still something left hidden?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.95,1:05:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.49,1:05:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know the legend...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.19,1:05:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...then don't let yourself\Nbe attacked by Otori-sama...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.40,1:05:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...and be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.10,1:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A person can't die from a legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.87,1:06:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.04,1:06:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Too insistent!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.24,1:06:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just before a murder occurs,\Nthe sound of something creaking is heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.14,1:06:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.91,1:06:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Otori-sama's wrathful cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.76,1:06:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You've realized it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.31,1:06:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.61,1:06:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm all better now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.85,1:06:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san, ever since your school days...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.22,1:06:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...it's said you've been investigating the Otori\Nlegend and legends of giant birds, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.02,1:06:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.99,1:06:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.89,1:07:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...also visit Jyugoya Village long ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.67,1:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.80,1:07:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That bronze mirror...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.01,1:07:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.17,1:07:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...that it's the true bronze mirror\Nfrom the Mozutobi Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.52,1:07:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Konno Machiko-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.76,1:07:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew her, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.43,1:07:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know who the culprit is, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.73,1:08:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.00,1:08:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ran!"
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.24,1:09:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"I see!"
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.21,1:09:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.28,1:09:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"I know now what the trick was."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.18,1:09:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Like I thought, he's the murderer..."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.96,1:09:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of the village are worried it'll\Nbecome dangerous if you come to the festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.90,1:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! It's best not to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.24,1:09:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it against the law if I do come?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.67,1:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.21,1:10:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You outsiders, acting all great!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.68,1:10:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Outsiders?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.55,1:10:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Currently I'm the largest\Nlandowner in this village.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.05,1:10:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Otori-sama...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.48,1:10:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...will make you his hayanie and...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.79,1:10:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you or anyone else says,\NI will go to the festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.09,1:10:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.09,1:10:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,On that day, I will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.70,1:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be under your care.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.10,1:10:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, go home for today.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.60,1:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second!\NHe'll cause trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.10,1:10:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobayashi-san, you go on home, too.\NLet's go, let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.01,1:10:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This murder case hasn't ended yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.85,1:10:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the culprit's primary goal...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.82,1:10:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...hasn't been achieved yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.39,1:10:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the culprit's goal?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.97,1:11:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Day of the Festival"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.82,1:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, this musical accompaniment\Nis rather weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.60,1:11:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.13,1:11:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this be okay!?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.73,1:11:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's sure to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.13,1:12:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Inner Sanctuary\NGod's Perch"
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.94,1:12:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The village chief...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.04,1:12:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...and those attending him...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.14,1:12:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...approach!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.02,1:12:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I am the owner of this village.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.44,1:12:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.54,1:13:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Calm down.\NOtori-sama, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.14,1:13:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, calm down.\NCalm down, Otori-sama.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.35,1:13:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.39,1:13:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Otori-sama, calm down. Calm down.\NCalm down. Calm down. Otori-sama, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.96,1:13:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, calm down.\NOtori-sama, calm down. Calm down...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.00,1:13:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Calm down. Otori-sama, calm down.\NCalm down, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.51,1:13:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.30,1:14:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.66,1:14:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wa... Wakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.93,1:14:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.31,1:15:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's not!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.72,1:15:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.39,1:15:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.76,1:15:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...encountering Otori-sama's curse\Nis just like an impossible crime.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.99,1:15:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help but think this couldn't\Npossibly be the act of a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.53,1:15:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.20,1:15:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...the culprit made use of that power...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.90,1:15:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...to make Kozaka-san and Ryoji-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.64,1:15:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...fly up onto the God's Perch where\Nthey were then stabbed and killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.55,1:15:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.48,1:15:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,When pressure is applied to water or air\Nin an airtight container...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.56,1:15:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...that pressure is transmitted to\Nevery part of the fluid at the same strength...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.70,1:15:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...so such a device is utilizing\NPascal's principle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.77,1:16:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath this village, a network of\Nunderground waterways have been stretched.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.87,1:16:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit used that to commit murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.94,1:16:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,First...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.44,1:16:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...water from the river is sidelined\Ninto a hole and temporarily held there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.55,1:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When the hole's lid is opened remotely,\Nthe water flows down it all at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.42,1:16:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This creates a huge amount of air pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.52,1:16:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This air pressure then spreads\Nthrough the waterway...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.82,1:16:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...springing up this slate.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.20,1:16:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That creaking sound you hear...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.86,1:16:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the sound of\Nthe lid cover being opened.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.11,1:16:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The first victim was Kozaka-san, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.78,1:16:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But, the one the culprit\Nwas aiming for that time was...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.01,1:16:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...Misa-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.85,1:16:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit, his target being Misa-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.52,1:16:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...chose his timing when she was\Nstanding on this slate to push the remote control.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.66,1:17:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,However, his timing was slightly off...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.86,1:17:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...so it was Kozaka-san who became the victim.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.67,1:17:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon that failure, the culprit decided to\Nsummon just his target alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.44,1:17:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Where are you?"
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.25,1:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.05,1:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In the same way,\Nhe then summoned his next target, Kotomi-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.22,1:17:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...but that crime ended in failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.43,1:17:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That was because there\Nwasn't enough air pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.63,1:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The previous night,\NRan had stumbled over it...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.80,1:17:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,...causing the slate to slip.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.74,1:17:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit hadn't noticed that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.68,1:17:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, the culprit targeted Wakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.51,1:17:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment that darkness fell,\Nthe culprit pressed the remote switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.39,1:18:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.86,1:18:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...that darkness...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.66,1:18:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...was a false solar eclipse\Ncreated by Ran and Sonoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.67,1:18:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit had unknowingly\Nfallen into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.48,1:18:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.75,1:18:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.49,1:18:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Police officer, Haji.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.92,1:18:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha... what's that?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.33,1:18:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.96,1:18:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? What evidence do you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.33,1:18:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.90,1:18:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.61,1:18:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your hand okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.48,1:18:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you're a right-handed person...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.65,1:19:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...you protected the right hand\Nthat Ran had kicked...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.08,1:19:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...and were using your left hand\Nto hold the screwdriver.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.15,1:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ah, good morning."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.69,1:19:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What you were fixing that time\Nwasn't the walkie-talkies...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.29,1:19:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...but the remote control.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.11,1:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason you were\Nattacking the Wakura family...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.01,1:19:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...was due to Konno Machko-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.48,1:19:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Her death is related to this, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.05,1:19:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,30 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.92,1:19:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...Machiko-san fell in love with Wakura-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.26,1:19:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...and she was the one\Nhe promised eternal love to.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.93,1:19:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He betrayed my mother and abandoned her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.71,1:20:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom believed in his oath...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.31,1:20:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...and waited and waited\Nand kept on waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.48,1:20:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.95,1:20:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Policeman Haji...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.69,1:20:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...Machiko-san was\Nyour true mother, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.36,1:20:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Around her meMōrial there were flowers\Nand Policeman Haji's footprints.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.87,1:20:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time of Machiko-san's death,\NHaji would have been 4 or 5 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.84,1:20:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,To have a person die when\Nyou're at such a young age...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.67,1:20:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...and yet come even now to pray for her...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.58,1:20:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...that would be unthinkable unless\Nit was anyone but your true mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.52,1:20:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You were really that boy then, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.23,1:20:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,25 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.53,1:21:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...Machiko suddenly appeared before me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.44,1:21:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Who is this child?"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.50,1:21:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She was with a small child.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.21,1:21:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"A relative's child."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.68,1:21:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"This is..."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.32,1:21:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"...the bronze mirror handed down\Nto the shrine that you wanted to see."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.66,1:21:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, the business I had\Nwas starting to take off...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.73,1:21:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...and had been picked up by the mass media.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.90,1:21:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression Machiko\Nhad come to extort money from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.18,1:21:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom didn't turn the bronze mirror\Nover to you because she wanted your money!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.45,1:21:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She just...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.92,1:21:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...wanted you...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.35,1:21:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...remember the vow of love\Nyou had made to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.26,1:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My betrayed mother...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.43,1:22:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...was closely embracing\Nthis bronze mirror when...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.40,1:22:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am truly...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.27,1:22:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.01,1:22:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.48,1:22:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the culprit's crimes...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.08,1:22:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...were to remind Wakura-san\Nof his betrayal of Machiko-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.65,1:22:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...and to take revenge for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.26,1:23:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my mistake...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.90,1:23:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...that caused all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.27,1:23:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The loss of Ryoji...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.04,1:23:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The loss of Kozaka-kun...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.51,1:23:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.12,1:23:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...that Machiko was left to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.49,1:23:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Having been in love during\Nthe days of your youth...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.09,1:23:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...isn't a cause for blame.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.63,1:23:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.00,1:23:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...it's said she was a woman\Nwhose life was driven mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.64,1:23:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lover's feelings...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.81,1:23:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...were much too strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.71,1:23:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.68,1:24:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...wasn't only Machiko's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.15,1:24:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I also messed up your life as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.69,1:24:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.26,1:24:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be you are mine and Machiko's...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.04,1:24:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no father.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.91,1:24:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely won't\Nacknowledge you as my father!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.98,1:24:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Policeman Haji!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.18,1:24:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I spoke to Wakura-san about my reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.02,1:24:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakura-san said...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.38,1:24:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't want you to let him\Ncommit any more crimes."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.29,1:24:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying so...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.16,1:24:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...he risked his life to cooperate with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.65,1:25:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a sad, lonely picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.49,1:25:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Policeman Haji.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.33,1:25:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For you...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.93,1:25:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...this crying woman was, you felt,\Njust like your mother, Machiko-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.24,1:25:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,These two bronze mirrors, when back to back,\Nexpress the full details of the legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.94,1:25:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The bronze mirror Wakura-san was holding\Ncontains the character for "man"...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.28,1:25:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...as the one who accomplished a betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.38,1:25:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On this bronze mirror,\Nthis character perhaps stands for "woman."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.56,1:25:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the detailed account of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.33,1:25:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.27,1:25:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Otori...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.40,1:26:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the incarnation of a woman\Nbetrayed by her lover.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.37,1:26:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's been handed down\Ngeneration to generation.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.05,1:26:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.15,1:26:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...though they had vowed and kissed\Nunder the God's Perch...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.12,1:26:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...the young man abandoned the woman...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.96,1:26:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.03,1:26:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For the woman...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.69,1:26:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...her passions turned into wings...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.37,1:26:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...and she became the huge, ugly Otori...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.30,1:26:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...to attack the man who had betrayed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.01,1:26:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman, cursed...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.51,1:26:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...ate the man and became the Otori.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.22,1:26:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the reason you wouldn't\Nexplain all the details of the legend...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.79,1:26:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...because you wanted to\Nprotect Policeman Haji?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.03,1:26:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.70,1:27:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...took pity on this child...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.07,1:27:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...and raised him with my own hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.67,1:27:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.74,1:27:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So when you told the\NWakura family members to leave this village...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.88,1:27:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...it was because you didn't want Policeman Haji\Nrepeating his crimes any more, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.59,1:27:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.79,1:27:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.03,1:28:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After 25 years,\Nthe true bronze mirror has returned.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.63,1:29:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.40,1:29:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A total solar eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.26,1:29:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Machiko!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.43,1:29:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Machiko has come back as the birds!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.35,1:30:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A flock of birds?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.39,1:30:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.25,1:30:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did a flock of birds hide the sun?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.72,1:30:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incredibly mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.97,1:30:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Megure?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.40,1:30:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.34,1:30:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally got the suspension bridge repaired.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.54,1:30:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the entire story.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.11,1:30:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good work, good work.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.12,1:30:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.99,1:30:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was here...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.70,1:31:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a sad case, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.84,1:31:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.28,1:31:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Ran.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.85,1:31:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.45,1:31:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,About what you said that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.75,1:31:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That time?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.76,1:31:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When we had fallen into that hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.59,1:31:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm happy that we came."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.66,1:31:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"But..."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.00,1:31:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"...even if it hadn't been me..."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.97,1:31:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"...you would have gone out\Nto rescue anyone, wouldn't you?"
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.87,1:31:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.81,1:31:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.88,1:31:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...did it BECAUSE it was Ran.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.57,1:32:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's Pascal!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.57,1:32:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A raccoon is called Rascal!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.34,1:32:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you, this one's called Pascal!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.24,1:32:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I deliver him to that owner,\Neverything will be completely settled!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.85,1:32:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be a trick!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.61,1:32:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be impossible for that owner\Nto be tricked by this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.62,1:32:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The main point is that it's the same breed!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.52,1:32:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally different!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.12,1:32:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.49,1:32:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.82,1:32:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth have you two been?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.13,1:32:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This absurdity of a man here\Nsaid he had to catch a raccoon...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.76,1:32:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...so after searching the mountains\Ncalling out, "Pascal, Pascal"...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.40,1:32:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the end what he got was...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.94,1:32:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.20,1:32:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you've been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.34,1:32:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.11,1:32:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The main thing is they're similar, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.98,1:32:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so itchy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.88,1:32:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Still... Pascal turned out to be a good tip.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.45,1:32:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.18,1:32:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that from the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.69,1:33:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I kept on\Ntelling you about Rascal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.76,1:33:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.32,1:33:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's supposed to be "Pascal."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.27,1:33:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't leave me behind!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.17,1:33:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I would help by\Nsaying Rascal and Pascal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.24,1:33:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's running away. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.54,1:33:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.21,1:33:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.96,1:33:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908,131)}There can only be a single truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.96,1:33:43.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1685,927)}This Drama is Fictional.
